{"schemaVersion":1,"records":[["open-nalan-0b1fc46bb93f6e6ef0be","詞",["再次看見星娥乘著碧海上的木筏，\n強忍笑意，輕輕梳理烏黑的髮髻。\n往常有多少個夜晚，\n月色明亮，微風細柔，\n今夜卻格外美好。\n暫且放下彩筆，不必閒來書寫字句。\n街頭的更鼓已經敲了三下，\n煙霧中的柳絲彷彿要輕柔擺動，\n露水微微閃爍著光澤，\n春天就在桃花之中。"],"6734bae2f7cdb81a3673b1877816cd496dcb14c0a8ae2b452d1abf2742546113",{"quality":"machine-draft-unreviewed","status":"pending-review","sourceLabel":"Leafbound AI 今譯 · 初步可用","displayStatus":"待人工校訂","productionReady":false,"model":"Qwen3.5-9B-Local","modelRevision":"local-deployment-2026-08-29","promptVersion":"leafbound-classical-v2","warnings":["paragraph-count-mismatch"],"generatedAt":"2026-08-29T12:16:38.432Z","editorialTriage":"initially-usable","review":{"reviewer":"Leafbound owner","reviewedAt":"2026-08-29T14:00:00.000Z","note":"初步抽查通過；仍待逐篇精校。"}}]]}
